  "description": "Commute, ride or explore\nTourus is our light gravel, all-road commuting, touring and utility bike. Playful and practical, it offers an outstanding blend of value, versatility, and performance everywhere. Whether mixing up the roads with the rough, heading out for a bike packing adventure, or getting to work and back swiftly and efficiently.\n\nHighlights\n– Fully featured, multi-butted 6061 T6 hydroformed frame.\n– Straight bladed 6061 alloy fork with mounting points.\n– 2x10 Shimano GRX transmission (46-30T x 11-34T).\n– Shimano GRX hydraulic disc brakes (180mm rotor front, 160mm rear).\n– High-volume Maxxis 700x45mm tyres on tubeless-ready rims.",
